 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Introduction",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 40.0,
   "x1": 43.0,
   "y1": 44.275,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": true,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When on board H.M.S. Beagle, as naturalist, I was much struck",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 48.537222222222226,
   "x1": 103.00000000000001,
   "y1": 51.62055555555556,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "with certain facts in the distribution of the inhabitants of",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 52.41777777777778,
   "x1": 103.00000000000001,
   "y1": 55.501111111111115,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "South America, and in the geological relations of the present to",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 56.29833333333333,
   "x1": 103.00000000000004,
   "y1": 59.38166666666667,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "the past inhabitants of that continent. These facts seemed to",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 60.178888888888885,
   "x1": 103.00000000000001,
   "y1": 63.26222222222222,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "me to throw some light on the origin of species—that mystery",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 64.05944444444444,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 67.14277777777777,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "of mysteries, as it has been called by one of our greatest",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 67.94,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 71.02333333333333,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "philosophers. On my return home, it occurred to me, in 1837,",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 71.82055555555556,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 74.90388888888889,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "that something might perhaps be made out on this question by",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 75.70111111111112,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 78.78444444444445,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "patiently accumulating and reflecting on all sorts of facts",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 79.58166666666668,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 82.665,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "which could possibly have any bearing on it. After five years’",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 83.46222222222224,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 86.54555555555557,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "work I allowed myself to speculate on the subject, and drew up",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 87.3427777777778,
   "x1": 102.99999999999999,
   "y1": 90.42611111111113,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "some short notes; these I enlarged in 1844 into a sketch of the",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 91.22333333333336,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 94.30666666666669,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "conclusions, which then seemed to me probable: from that",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 95.10388888888892,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 98.18722222222225,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "period to the present day I have steadily pursued the same",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 98.98444444444448,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 102.0677777777778,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "object. I hope that I may be excused for entering on these per-",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 102.86500000000004,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 105.94833333333337,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": true,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "sonal details, as I give them to show that I have not been hasty",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 106.7455555555556,
   "x1": 103.00000000000004,
   "y1": 109.82888888888893,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "in coming to a decision.",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 110.62611111111116,
   "x1": 49.666666666666664,
   "y1": 113.70944444444449,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My work is now nearly finished; but as it will take me two",
   "x0": 22.75,
   "y0": 114.50666666666672,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 117.59000000000005,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "or three more years to complete it, and as my health is far",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 118.38722222222228,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 121.4705555555556,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "from strong, I have been urged to publish this Abstract. I have",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 122.26777777777784,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 125.35111111111117,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "more especially been induced to do this, as Mr. Wallace, who is",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 126.1483333333334,
   "x1": 103.00000000000004,
   "y1": 129.23166666666674,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "now studying the natural history of the Malay archipelago, has",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 130.02888888888896,
   "x1": 102.99999999999999,
   "y1": 133.1122222222223,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "arrived at almost exactly the same general conclusions that I",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 133.90944444444452,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 136.99277777777786,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "have on the origin of species. Last year he sent to me a memoir",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 137.79000000000008,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 140.87333333333342,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "on this subject, with a request that I would forward it to Sir",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 141.67055555555564,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 144.75388888888898,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Charles Lyell, who sent it to the Linnean Society, and it is pub-",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 145.5511111111112,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 148.63444444444454,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": true,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "lished in the third volume of the Journal of that Society.",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 149.43166666666676,
   "x1": 92.5,
   "y1": 152.5150000000001,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This Abstract, which I now publish, must necessarily be",
   "x0": 22.75,
   "y0": 153.31222222222232,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 156.39555555555566,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "imperfect. I cannot here give references and authorities for my",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 157.19277777777788,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 160.27611111111122,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "several statements; and I must trust to the reader reposing",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 161.07333333333344,
   "x1": 103.00000000000001,
   "y1": 164.15666666666678,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "some confidence in my accuracy. No doubt errors will have",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 164.953888888889,
   "x1": 102.99999999999999,
   "y1": 168.03722222222234,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "crept in, though I hope I have always been cautious in trusting",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 168.83444444444456,
   "x1": 103.00000000000001,
   "y1": 171.9177777777779,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "to good authorities alone. I can here give only the general",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 172.71500000000012,
   "x1": 103.00000000000004,
   "y1": 175.79833333333346,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "conclusions at which I have arrived, with a few facts in",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 176.59555555555568,
   "x1": 102.99999999999996,
   "y1": 179.67888888888902,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "illustration, but which, I hope, in most cases will suffice. No",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 180.47611111111124,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 183.55944444444458,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "one can feel more sensible than I do of the necessity of hereaf-",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 184.3566666666668,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 187.44000000000014,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": true,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "ter publishing in detail all the facts, with references, on which",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 188.23722222222236,
   "x1": 103.00000000000001,
   "y1": 191.3205555555557,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "my conclusions have been grounded; and I hope in a future",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 192.11777777777792,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 195.20111111111126,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "work to do this. For I am well aware that scarcely a single",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 195.99833333333348,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 199.08166666666682,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "point is discussed in this volume on which facts cannot be",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 199.87888888888904,
   "x1": 103.00000000000004,
   "y1": 202.96222222222238,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "adduced, often apparently leading to conclusions directly",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 203.7594444444446,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 206.84277777777794,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "opposite to those at which I have arrived. A fair result can be",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 207.64000000000016,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 210.7233333333335,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "obtained only by fully stating and balancing the facts and",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 211.52055555555572,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 214.60388888888906,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "arguments on both sides of each question; and this cannot pos-",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 215.40111111111128,
   "x1": 103.00000000000004,
   "y1": 218.48444444444462,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": true,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "sibly be here done.",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 219.28166666666684,
   "x1": 43.416666666666664,
   "y1": 222.36500000000018,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In considering the Origin of Species, it is quite conceivable",
   "x0": 22.75,
   "y0": 223.1622222222224,
   "x1": 102.99999999999999,
   "y1": 226.24555555555574,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "that a naturalist, reflecting on the mutual affinities of organic",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 227.04277777777796,
   "x1": 102.99999999999999,
   "y1": 230.1261111111113,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "beings, on their embryological relations, their geographical",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 230.92333333333352,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 234.00666666666686,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "distribution, geological succession, and other such facts, might",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 234.80388888888908,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 237.88722222222242,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "come to the conclusion that each species had not been",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 238.68444444444464,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 241.76777777777798,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "independently created, but had descended, like varieties, from",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 242.5650000000002,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 245.64833333333354,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "other species. Nevertheless, such a conclusion, even if well",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 246.44555555555576,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 249.5288888888891,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "founded, would be unsatisfactory, until it could be shown how",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 18,
   "x1": 194.99999999999997,
   "y1": 21.083333333333332,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "the innumerable species inhabiting this world have been",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 21.880555555555556,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 24.96388888888889,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "modified, so as to acquire that perfection of structure and",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 25.761111111111113,
   "x1": 194.99999999999991,
   "y1": 28.844444444444445,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "coadaptation which most justly excites our admiration.",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 29.64166666666667,
   "x1": 184.33333333333334,
   "y1": 32.725,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Naturalists continually refer to external conditions, such as",
   "x0": 114.75,
   "y0": 33.522222222222226,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 36.60555555555556,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "climate, food, and so on, as the only possible cause of variation.",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 37.40277777777778,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 40.486111111111114,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In one very limited sense, as we shall hereafter see, this may",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 41.28333333333333,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 44.36666666666667,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "be true; but it is preposterous to attribute to mere external",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 45.163888888888884,
   "x1": 195.00000000000009,
   "y1": 48.24722222222222,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "conditions, the structure, for instance, of the woodpecker, with",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 49.04444444444444,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 52.12777777777777,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "its feet, tail, beak, and tongue, so admirably adapted to catch",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 52.92499999999999,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 56.008333333333326,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "insects under the bark of trees. In the case of the misseltoe,",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 56.80555555555554,
   "x1": 194.99999999999997,
   "y1": 59.88888888888888,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "which draws its nourishment from certain trees, which has",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 60.686111111111096,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 63.76944444444443,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "seeds that must be transported by certain birds, and which has",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 64.56666666666665,
   "x1": 194.99999999999991,
   "y1": 67.64999999999998,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "flowers with separate sexes absolutely requiring the agency of",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 68.44722222222221,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 71.53055555555554,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "certain insects to bring pollen from one flower to the other, it",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 72.32777777777777,
   "x1": 194.99999999999997,
   "y1": 75.4111111111111,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "is equally preposterous to account for the structure of this",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 76.20833333333333,
   "x1": 195.00000000000009,
   "y1": 79.29166666666666,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "parasite, with its relations to several distinct organic beings,",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 80.08888888888889,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 83.17222222222222,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "by the effects of external conditions, or of habit, or of the",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 83.96944444444445,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 87.05277777777778,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "volition of the plant itself.",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 87.85000000000001,
   "x1": 144.58333333333334,
   "y1": 90.93333333333334,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It is, therefore, of the highest importance to gain a clear",
   "x0": 114.75,
   "y0": 91.73055555555557,
   "x1": 195.00000000000003,
   "y1": 94.8138888888889,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "insight into the means of modification and coadaptation. At",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 95.61111111111113,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 98.69444444444446,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "the commencement of my observations it seemed to me",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 99.49166666666669,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 102.57500000000002,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "probable that a careful study of domesticated animals and of",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 103.37222222222225,
   "x1": 194.99999999999997,
   "y1": 106.45555555555558,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "cultivated plants would offer the best chance of making out",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 107.25277777777781,
   "x1": 195.00000000000003,
   "y1": 110.33611111111114,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "this obscure problem. Nor have I been disappointed; in this",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 111.13333333333337,
   "x1": 195.00000000000003,
   "y1": 114.2166666666667,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "and in all other perplexing cases I have invariably found that",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 115.01388888888893,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 118.09722222222226,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "our knowledge, imperfect though it be, of variation under",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 118.89444444444449,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 121.97777777777782,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "domestication, afforded the best and safest clue. I may venture",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 122.77500000000005,
   "x1": 194.99999999999991,
   "y1": 125.85833333333338,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "to express my conviction of the high value of such studies,",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 126.65555555555561,
   "x1": 195.00000000000009,
   "y1": 129.73888888888894,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "although they have been very commonly neglected by",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 130.53611111111115,
   "x1": 194.33333333333334,
   "y1": 133.6194444444445,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "naturalists.",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 134.4166666666667,
   "x1": 125.25,
   "y1": 137.50000000000006,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From these considerations, I shall devote the first chapter",
   "x0": 114.75,
   "y0": 138.29722222222227,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 141.38055555555562,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "of this Abstract to Variation under Domestication. We shall",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 142.17777777777783,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 145.26111111111118,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "thus see that a large amount of hereditary modification is at",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 146.0583333333334,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 149.14166666666674,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "least possible; and, what is equally or more important, we shall",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 149.93888888888895,
   "x1": 194.99999999999991,
   "y1": 153.0222222222223,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "see how great is the power of man in accumulating by his",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 153.8194444444445,
   "x1": 195.00000000000003,
   "y1": 156.90277777777786,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Selection successive slight variations. I will then pass on to the",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 157.70000000000007,
   "x1": 194.99999999999997,
   "y1": 160.78333333333342,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "variability of species in a state of nature; but I am unfor-",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 161.58055555555563,
   "x1": 195.00000000000009,
   "y1": 164.66388888888898,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": true,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "tunately compelled to treat this subject far too briefly, as it can",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 165.4611111111112,
   "x1": 195.00000000000003,
   "y1": 168.54444444444454,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "be treated properly only by giving long catalogues of facts. We",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 169.34166666666675,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 172.4250000000001,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "shall, however, be enabled to discuss what circumstances are",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 173.2222222222223,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 176.30555555555566,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "most favourable to variation. In the next chapter the Struggle",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 177.10277777777787,
   "x1": 194.99999999999997,
   "y1": 180.18611111111122,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "for Existence amongst all organic beings throughout the world,",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 180.98333333333343,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 184.06666666666678,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "which inevitably follows from their high geometrical powers",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 184.863888888889,
   "x1": 194.99999999999997,
   "y1": 187.94722222222234,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "of increase, will be treated of. This is the doctrine of Malthus,",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 188.74444444444455,
   "x1": 194.99999999999991,
   "y1": 191.8277777777779,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "applied to the whole animal and vegetable kingdoms. As many",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 192.6250000000001,
   "x1": 194.99999999999997,
   "y1": 195.70833333333346,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "more individuals of each species are born than can possibly",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 196.50555555555567,
   "x1": 194.99999999999997,
   "y1": 199.58888888888902,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "survive; and as, consequently, there is a frequently recurring",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 200.38611111111123,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 203.46944444444458,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "struggle for existence, it follows that any being, if it vary",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 204.2666666666668,
   "x1": 195.00000000000003,
   "y1": 207.35000000000014,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "however slightly in any manner profitable to itself, under the",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 208.14722222222235,
   "x1": 195.00000000000009,
   "y1": 211.2305555555557,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "complex and sometimes varying conditions of life, will have a",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 212.0277777777779,
   "x1": 195.00000000000009,
   "y1": 215.11111111111126,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "better chance of surviving, and thus be naturally selected.",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 215.90833333333347,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 218.99166666666682,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From the strong principle of inheritance, any selected variety",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 219.78888888888903,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 222.87222222222238,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "will tend to propagate its new and modified form.",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 223.6694444444446,
   "x1": 176.91666666666666,
   "y1": 226.75277777777794,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I. The Period",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 230.6544444444446,
   "x1": 134.91536458333334,
   "y1": 234.9294444444446,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": true,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It was the best of times, it was the worst of times, it was the",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 239.19166666666683,
   "x1": 195.00000000000009,
   "y1": 242.27500000000018,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "age of wisdom, it was the age of foolishness, it was the epoch",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 243.0722222222224,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 246.15555555555574,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "of belief, it was the epoch of incredulity, it was the season of",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 246.95277777777795,
   "x1": 195.00000000000003,
   "y1": 250.0361111111113,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  }
 ],
 "meta": [
